<%- include('partials/head', { title }) %>
<section class="hero">
  <h1>Get paid when the work is verified.</h1>
  <p class="lead">The client holds the milestone payment in PayPal. An AI verifier opens the delivered URL, checks every acceptance criterion, and the payment goes to the freelancer only when all of them pass.</p>
  <a class="btn primary" href="/new">Create a milestone</a>
</section>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><b>Fund</b> The client pays with PayPal. The money is authorized (held), not charged.</li>
  <li><b>Submit</b> The freelancer submits a URL to the work.</li>
  <li><b>Verify</b> The verifier takes screenshots and checks each criterion.</li>
  <li><b>Pay</b> Pass: the payment is captured to the freelancer. Fail: the freelancer can resubmit, or the client can cancel.</li>
</ol>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
